<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main" show="0"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{1DECCEE7-E78A-6581-D8DF-4A7AEC310997}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Title 1"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{3A860538-A174-F1BC-381B-89AD208E968A}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="title"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Content</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="Content Placeholder 2"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{CD62BAE5-973F-F885-D93F-7753C86FCB58}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="1333499" y="1865019"/><a:ext cx="9743575" cy="4820528"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr><a:normAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Motivation</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Talking about the historical context, recent engineering applications and manufacturing methods. Give examples from composites for the weaves, nonwovens and </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>polycatenated</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t> for the chainmail. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Challenge is the systematic design</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Show prior work in this context and point out the knowledge gap, the systematic design is not there</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Our goal is to create large systematic design space that enables taxonomy of structures</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Conceptual Preliminary</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Talk about topological labeling of entities, gives ideas from Cem’s , Randal’s </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>knittings</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t> and Ergun’s weaves</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>In a simple 2D weave case talk about the GS and introduce the volumetric topological labels for 2D(up and down)</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Scope And Approach</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Now introduce the scope as topological labeling, and most of the times cell induced topological labeling for volumetric weaves, links and truss systems</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Research Overview</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Design</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Mesh Links</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>cP</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t> - Nonwovens</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Proposed Work</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Manufacturing</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="1257300" lvl="2" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Methodology</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="800100" lvl="1" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Application</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="1257300" lvl="2" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Methodology</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Slide Number Placeholder 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{18ACA91D-8CE5-2445-C1C6-48EA6F8CC8C0}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="sldNum" sz="quarter" idx="12"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:fld id="{8A97BCD7-5050-4419-89E2-7F89E6A5C032}" type="slidenum"><a:rPr lang="en-US" smtClean="0"/><a:t>3</a:t></a:fld><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="823381152"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>